## Original Content
Selon les médias américains CBS et Axios, le patron de la CIA, John Ratcliffe, est en visite mardi à Moscou. Une annonce que ni le gouvernement américain ni le Kremlin n'ont jusqu'ici officiellement confirmé.

## Summary
CIA Director John Ratcliffe is reportedly visiting Moscow on Tuesday, according to American media reports from CBS and Axios. However, neither the U.S. government nor the Kremlin have officially confirmed this visit.

## Key Points
- CIA Director John Ratcliffe is visiting Moscow.
- The visit is reported by American media outlets CBS and Axios.
- Neither the U.S. government nor the Kremlin have officially confirmed the visit.
- The visit is scheduled for Tuesday, based on media reports.


